{"key": "763bb7d5db989ec63112d6569b9deeec", "model": "claude-sonnet-5-5", "response": {"content": [{"text": "Yesterday's approved sales (5 sales, R$ 814,40 in total):\n\n| Method | Sales | Total | Deposit date | Status |\n|---|---|---|---|---|\n| Pix | 1 | R$ 64,00 | 2026-11-02 (yesterday) | Paid |\n| Debit | 2 | R$ 200,50 | 2026-11-03 (today) | Paid |\n| Credit | 2 | R$ 549,90 | 2026-12-02 (in 29 days) | Scheduled |\n\nI can't answer the bank account question for Pix from your records. Another specialist handles that one.", "type": "text"}], "id": "msg_011Cggf26ox5UUwmEzn77g3c", "model": "claude-sonnet-5-5", "role": "assistant", "stop_reason": "end_turn", "type": "message", "usage": {"cache_creation": {"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens": 0, "ephemeral_5m_input_tokens": 0}, "cache_creation_input_tokens": 0, "cache_read_input_tokens": 0, "inference_geo": "global", "input_tokens": 3793, "output_tokens": 205, "output_tokens_details": {"thinking_tokens": 0}, "service_tier": "standard", "speed": "standard"}}, "role": "agent", "scope": "parallel-04#0"}
