{"key": "69141ca563d381a858acbe74fd685976", "model": "claude-sonnet-5-5", "response": {"content": [{"text": "**Pix and bank account:** Yes, in practice you need one. To sign up for Pix with Getnet, you register a Pix key linked to the receiving account (domicílio bancário) where you want the money. You enter that key in the Minha Conta portal or the Getnet app [sup-duvidas-81, sup-duvidas-82]. Pix itself can run through a checking, savings or prepaid payment account [sup-duvidas-59].\n\n**Yesterday's sales:** You had 5 approved sales totaling R$ 814,40.\n\n| Method | Sales | Total | Deposit date | Status |\n|---|---|---|---|---|\n| Pix | 1 | R$ 64,00 | 2026-11-02 | Paid |\n| Debit | 2 | R$ 200,50 | 2026-11-03 (today) | Paid |\n| Credit | 2 | R$ 549,90 | 2026-12-02 (in 29 days) | Scheduled |", "type": "text"}], "id": "msg_011Cggf3GCGoFyo4teX3HPLX", "model": "claude-sonnet-5-5", "role": "assistant", "stop_reason": "end_turn", "type": "message", "usage": {"cache_creation": {"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens": 0, "ephemeral_5m_input_tokens": 0}, "cache_creation_input_tokens": 0, "cache_read_input_tokens": 0, "inference_geo": "global", "input_tokens": 3506, "output_tokens": 317, "output_tokens_details": {"thinking_tokens": 0}, "service_tier": "standard", "speed": "standard"}}, "role": "supervisor", "scope": "parallel-04#0"}
