{"key": "06a6095f5c6f73b4055c1941c45c04f7", "model": "claude-sonnet-5-5", "response": {"content": [{"text": "The Get Smart is a smart card machine. You can control stock, place orders, close tabs, load menus and issue invoices directly on the device [1]. It runs Android, and all your sales are processed by Getnet [3].\n\nI can't tell you whether your terminals are online from these passages. If you confirm which terminal ID to check, a status lookup can show that, but I haven't run one.\n\nFor a Get Clássica with no signal, the sources only cover chip setup. They don't have a full troubleshooting guide. The steps are:\n- With the machine off, open the back cover and insert the chip in the slot marked SIM1 or SIM2, metal side facing down [6].\n- Close the cover, turn the machine on and wait for the data network to connect [6].\n- When it shows a connected network (2G or 3G), it's ready to use [6].\n- Run a communication test to check the chip's connectivity [6].\n\nThe sources don't give any other steps for a terminal that stays offline. I can propose opening a technical support ticket for the terminal. Nothing runs until you confirm [policy:capabilities].\n\nMISSING: Troubleshooting steps for a Get Clássica that stays offline or has no signal after the chip is installed", "type": "text"}], "id": "msg_011Cggf3dHJ87N83D6YGbdR9", "model": "claude-sonnet-5-5", "role": "assistant", "stop_reason": "end_turn", "type": "message", "usage": {"cache_creation": {"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens": 0, "ephemeral_5m_input_tokens": 0}, "cache_creation_input_tokens": 0, "cache_read_input_tokens": 0, "inference_geo": "global", "input_tokens": 5370, "output_tokens": 388, "output_tokens_details": {"thinking_tokens": 0}, "service_tier": "standard", "speed": "standard"}}, "role": "agent", "scope": "parallel-02#0"}
{"key": "b5ec05b96ffada04c332afa7b2efb05f", "model": "claude-sonnet-5-5", "response": {"content": [{"text": "Only one of your two terminals is online.\n\n**What the Get Smart is:** It's a smart card machine that runs Android. On the device you can control stock, place orders, close tabs, load a menu and issue invoices. You can also integrate it with your establishment's system [sup-duvidas-get-smart-10]. Getnet processes all sales on it [sup-duvidas-get-smart-17]. It's listed at R$ 129,90/month [prod-todas-as-maquininhas-04].\n\n**Your terminals:**\n- **T1988A (Get Smart):** online over Wi-Fi with good signal. Last contact was 2026-11-03 20:51.\n- **T1988B (Get Clássica):** offline, with no signal on the chip. Last contact was 2026-11-03 15:51, so it has been offline for 5 hours.\n\n**For T1988B:** the sources only cover chip setup [sup-duvidas-06]:\n1. With the machine off, insert the chip in the SIM1 or SIM2 slot, metal side down.\n2. Close the cover, turn the machine on and wait for the data network to connect.\n3. When it shows a network (2G or 3G), run a communication test.\n\nThe sources have no other steps for a terminal that stays offline. I can propose a support ticket for T1988B. It's only a proposal and nothing runs until you confirm [policy:capabilities].", "type": "text"}], "id": "msg_011Cggf3t5ms98KvsWEZ47sb", "model": "claude-sonnet-5-5", "role": "assistant", "stop_reason": "end_turn", "type": "message", "usage": {"cache_creation": {"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens": 0, "ephemeral_5m_input_tokens": 0}, "cache_creation_input_tokens": 0, "cache_read_input_tokens": 0, "inference_geo": "global", "input_tokens": 4432, "output_tokens": 449, "output_tokens_details": {"thinking_tokens": 0}, "service_tier": "standard", "speed": "standard"}}, "role": "supervisor", "scope": "parallel-02#0"}
